# Paths under src-tauri/ that must NOT restart a running `tauri dev`.
#
# Generated from skills/redline-plan-review/SKILL.md by
# scripts/gen-codex-contract.mjs, which `npm run build` runs via `prebuild`.
# It is only "Rust source" in the include_str! sense (codex_profile.rs), so a
# rewrite of it forces cargo to relink the whole crate — and the watcher kills
# the running app to do it. That is how two Front Door plan sessions took the
# dev host down on 2026-09-01: each ran `ANALYZE=1 npm run build` about twenty
# seconds in, and the app vanished mid-review with no crash report.
#
# The generator now only writes when the bytes actually change; this covers the
# case where they do. A real contract change is picked up by the next restart.
src/codex_plan_contract.txt
